<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Gouri Bhati — Social Media Manager & Content Creator</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --cream: #F5F0E8;
    --warm-white: #FDFAF5;
    --charcoal: #1C1C1C;
    --soft-black: #2A2A2A;
    --terracotta: #C4623A;
    --muted: #7A7570;
    --light-border: #E2DDD5;
    --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; background: var(--warm-white); color: var(--soft-black); overflow-x: hidden; }

  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    padding: 1.2rem 4rem;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    background: rgba(253,250,245,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light-border);
  }
  .nav-logo { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--charcoal); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); transition: color 0.3s; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--terracotta); }

  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center;
    padding: 8rem 4rem 4rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-bg-text {
    position: absolute; right: -2rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 22vw; font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(196,98,58,0.05); pointer-events: none; user-select: none;
  }
  .hero-content { max-width: 680px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .hero-tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terracotta);
    border: 1px solid var(--terracotta); padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem; animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
  }
  .hero-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 300; line-height: 0.95; color: var(--charcoal); letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.1s ease both;
  }
  .hero-name span { font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; color: var(--terracotta); }
  .hero-desc {
    margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 520px; font-weight: 300; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s ease both;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    margin-top: 2.5rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.3s ease both;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--charcoal); color: #fff; padding: 0.9rem 2rem; border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--terracotta); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-outline {
    border: 1.5px solid var(--charcoal); color: var(--charcoal); padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--terracotta); color: var(--terracotta); }

  .open-banner {
    margin-top: 3.5rem; padding: 1.4rem 2rem;
    background: var(--cream); border-radius: 10px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--terracotta);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.2rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s ease both;
  }
  .open-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4ADE80; flex-shrink: 0; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .open-text { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--soft-black); line-height: 1.5; }
  .open-text strong { color: var(--charcoal); font-weight: 600; }

  section { padding: 6rem 4rem; }
  .section-label { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terracotta); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .section-heading { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 600; color: var(--charcoal); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .section-sub { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 540px; font-weight: 300; }

  .about-section { background: var(--cream); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 5rem; margin-top: 4rem; align-items: start; }
  .about-text p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A4540; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 300; }
  .about-details { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; }
  .detail-row {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--warm-white); border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid var(--terracotta);
  }
  .detail-icon { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(196,98,58,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .detail-key { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .detail-val { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--charcoal); margin-top: 0.1rem; }

  .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-card {
    background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--light-border); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem; transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .service-card::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
    background: var(--terracotta); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--terracotta); }
  .service-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
  .service-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .service-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--charcoal); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .service-desc { font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 300; }
  .service-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; }
  .tag { font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem; background: var(--cream); color: var(--muted); border-radius: 100px; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid var(--light-border); }

  .why-section { background: var(--charcoal); }
  .why-section .section-heading { color: #fff; }
  .why-section .section-label { color: var(--terracotta); }
  .why-section .section-sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
  .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .why-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; transition: border-color 0.3s, background 0.3s;
  }
  .why-card:hover { border-color: var(--terracotta); background: rgba(196,98,58,0.08); }
  .why-num { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(196,98,58,0.3); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .why-title { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .why-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight: 300; }

  .skills-section { background: var(--cream); }
  .skills-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .skill-item {
    background: var(--warm-white); border: 1px solid var(--light-border); border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .skill-item:hover { border-color: var(--terracotta); transform: translateX(4px); }
  .skill-emoji { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .skill-name { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--charcoal); line-height: 1.3; }

  .contact-section { background: var(--charcoal); text-align: center; }
  .contact-section .section-heading { color: #fff; }
  .contact-section .section-label { color: var(--terracotta); }
  .contact-desc { font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); max-width: 460px; margin: 1rem auto 0; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; }
  .contact-cards { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .contact-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem 2rem; text-align: left; min-width: 200px;
    transition: all 0.3s; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .contact-card:hover { border-color: var(--terracotta); background: rgba(196,98,58,0.1); transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .contact-card-label { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terracotta); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .contact-card-value { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #fff; }
  .remote-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(196,98,58,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(196,98,58,0.3);
    border-radius: 100px; padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 500; color: #E8A080;
    margin-top: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .remote-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #4ADE80; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }

  footer { background: #111; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-align: center; padding: 2rem; font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.4; } }
  .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }
  .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
    section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
    .hero { padding: 6rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .contact-cards { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">Gouri Bhati</div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
    <li><a href="#why">Why Me</a></li>
    <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg-text">GB</div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-tag">✦ Open for Freelance Projects</div>
    <h1 class="hero-name">Gouri<br><span>Bhati</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      Social Media Manager &amp; Content Creator helping brands grow on Instagram — through scroll-stopping reels, strategic content, and design that gets results.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Hire Me</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn-outline">What I Offer</a>
    </div>
    <div class="open-banner">
      <div class="open-dot"></div>
      <div class="open-text">
        <strong>Currently taking on new clients.</strong><br>
        Based in Jaisalmer, Rajasthan — working remotely with brands anywhere in India and worldwide.
      </div>
